WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:06,430
What did you do to cause a perforated stomach?

2
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,950
Mom, forget it. I don’t want to care about it either.

3
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,150
I just feel angry

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,550
We can't just let it go

5
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,550
Do you want me to invite grandpa over?

6
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:15,550
Whatever you want

7
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,670
I don't have time to chat with you.

8
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,580
The baby looks at what the mother has brought

9
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:41,110
Weird baby, mother misses you too, does it hurt?

10
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:47,990
Pain, pain in hands, pain in feet and legs

11
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:49,790
Childhood hurts too

12
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:51,230
Baby it hurts so much

13
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:52,190
How about a shot?

14
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,800
give a shot

15
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,800
It's fine after the injection. It doesn't hurt anymore.
